    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94867" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκιμᾱλίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>jeer at, flout</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινα</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pax</u>
				549
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥηματίοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ach.</u>
					444
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ποδί</span>
			<i>kick</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				7.17
			</span></i>; expld. as 
				Att.
			 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταδακτυλίζω</span> by
				<i><span class="en">
				Moer.
				p.360
			</span></i> P., <i><span class="en">
				Phryn.
				<u>PS</u>
				p.83
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i>, cf. Sch.Ar.Il.cc.; also expld. by Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pax</u>
			</span></i> l.c. as <i>to hold up the middle finger</i> (sens. obsc.).
			[The quantity of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκι-</span> is not
			determined.]</div>
